Subject: [PATCH] Linear linearstats Adventure panel + bridge sync overload
 (paper-0013)

Loop-3 (agent 27, PATCH8): coloured ALIGNED Adventure panel for
/linearstats (per-world region/poi/entities sections, human units,
dirty-depth bar, per-world level + time-since-last-flush via m0015
counters, TOTALS footer). Keeps empty-state line, keeps
linear.command.linearstats permission. ALSO adds
LinearFlushBridge#notifyFlushSync (no Plugin, sync fire) for the
server-internal call site after flushDirty (NMS minecraft-0019, same
PATCH8); async notifyFlush(Plugin) unchanged. m0015 snapshot already
carries new fields; this wires the display.

rc2 (Loop-3 fix-up, D1): resolveCompressionLevel no longer assumes the
folder parent equals the Bukkit world name (Folia dimension dirs yield
`overworld`/`the_nether`/`the_end`, Bukkit wants the level name).
Direct lookup first, then dimension-id match across loaded worlds;
still -1 (panel `?`) when unresolvable, never throws.

